ue":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-04T16:39:30-08:00","id":302744,"title":"","content":"Just re-sent the roll results, Dwy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-04T17:27:30-08:00","id":302772,"title":"","content":"Waiting for carp to respond, unfortunately.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T00:20:44-08:00","id":303044,"title":"","content":"Ah, there we are, and here's a roll to diagnose anybody left in that mangled heap. Malory's concerned with &quot;will they die or get permanently crippled if I don't act soon?&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4705480/\" target=\"_blank\">Int+Medicine, diagnosis (1d10=4, 1d10=3, 1d10=3, 1d10=1, 1d10=4, 1d10=9, 1d10=9)</a><br /> <br /> If they will, she's gonna try the doors, cut some seatbelts and extract the poor bastard for treatment. Even odds that the doors are a warped and mangled mess, though, so she'll spend a little WP and...<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4705484/\" target=\"_blank\">Break dat window! (1d10=9, 1d10=7, 1d10=2, 1d10=3, 1d10=8, 1d10=3)</a><br /> <br /> Strength 1, Athletics 1, giving her +1 for doing it with a flashlight rather than her hand, +3 from Willlpower..<br /> <br /> Huh, and I forgot the penalty already. Oh well, still two successes even if we lose the last die.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T14:34:42-08:00","id":303748,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the wait, Thrythlind.<br /> <br /> Dwyad and ATwannabe, you don't need to make multiple rolls, you can use the &quot;hitsopen&quot; code to roll the entire dice pool in one roll and it'll automatically count successes and make re-rolls.<br /> <br /> All you have to do is put in &quot;Xd10.hitsopen(8,10)&quot; where X is your dice pool. The 8 in the parentheses is the target number for successes, which can be adjusted to 10 for a luck die. The 10 in the parentheses is the minimum number for re-rolls, which can be adjusted to 9 and 8 for 9-again and 8-again respectively. If the roll lacks 10-again, use &quot;Xd10.hits(8)&quot; instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 11-05-2014, 05:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T01:59:28-08:00","id":304298,"title":"","content":"Note, I am not a doctor, Malory's infinitely better at doctorin' than I am, but from my understanding the biggest threat is bleeding out from a severed limb. An improvised tourniquet risks killing more tissue, but will stop her from dying long enough to try...<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4706781/\" target=\"_blank\">Fixin' up the baby! (7d10.hitsopen(8,10)=2)</a><br /> <br /> That!<br /> <br /> If I can get the kid stabilized, we'll see if Eternal Spring can pop a foot back on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T17:11:55-08:00","id":305116,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4707565/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4707565/</a> sorry, I can't seem to get the account to work, but it looks like Freddy doesn't trip. Clarification: Is the light on the bridge or off it? Or can Freddy not tell?<br /> <br /> thanks,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2734-atwannabe","name":"ATwannabe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2734_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T18:18:48-08:00","id":305151,"title":"","content":"Perception check, AT. Dwy, Dex + Medicine to get the tourniquet on correctly (and don't forget the penalty for the dust). An additional -1 for using improvised tools.<br /> <br /> AT, what's going wrong? Have you gotten the account created and are having trouble signing in?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","user":"HobbitGuy1420","date":". 11-06-2014, 09:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T04:59:19-08:00","id":305536,"title":"","content":"I'm a Chiurgeon, our whole thing is putting people back together with paperclips and bubblegum!<br /> <br /> &quot;The Chiiurgeon can use the humblest tools well, and never suffers a penalty for poor equipment so long as at least something can be jury-rigged as a medical tool.&quot;<br /> <br /> And on review, I also get 9-again Medicine. Pity I also get 9-again Dexterity, and they don't stack.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4707970/\" target=\"_blank\">We got a bleeder! (7d10.hitsopen(8,9)=3)</a><br /> <br /> Aced it. Ghoul girl here, savin' lives!<br /> <br /> <br /> AT: the light on the bridge is Mal's flashlight, indicating the car that's precariously perched on the precipice of peril. So, technically on it, because she's indicating the side.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3994,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","user":"Dwyad","date":". 11-07-2014, 08:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T05:22:45-08:00","id":305551,"title":"","content":"...Right. Nix the additional penalty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-08T16:30:47-08:00","id":307018,"title":"","content":"Alright, this godforsaken dust cloud is getting to be a massive pain in the ass. Y'know what keeps dust down? Rain. Hopefully we can spare a few minutes before anybody dies horribly.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4709974/\" target=\"_blank\">Spending 1 WP, 1 Glamour. Make it rain! (10d10.hitsopen(8,10)=4)</a><br /> <br /> Almost!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4709975/\" target=\"_blank\">No, seriously, make with the rain! (7d10.hitsopen(8,10)=2)</a><br /> <br /> So it takes ten minutes 1 glamour and 1 WP, but that should keep the kid from horking up blood-flecked concrete dust.<br /> <br /> That's right, we just found a stunningly practical use for Eternal Spring 2.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=82NjJjhsHag\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=82NjJjhsHag\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=82NjJjhsHag\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=82NjJjhsHag </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The fae song in question, of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-08T23:53:52-08:00","id":307213,"title":"","content":"Erm... while you start singing, the baby's health visibly fades. If left in the cloud, it won't last ten minutes. Neither, if you're any judge, will the mother; she's still bleeding, if more slowly, and there are internal injuries there as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","user":"HobbitGuy1420","date":".  Cutting out unneeded snark. 11-09-2014, 02:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-09T00:35:35-08:00","id":307243,"title":"","content":"Well now, things are a fair bit more desperate than I thought! Presumably the inside of the car is a dusty hellhole just as much as the outside, given that the windows are blown out...<br /> <br /> The other cars about - the one that performed the T-boning and the one that's about to go over the bridge - are they fairly sealed against the concrete sandstorm?<br /> <br /> If no, how far to the edge of the maelstrom? Do I think I can make it on foot before this baby dies an ignoble death?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3994,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","user":"Dwyad","date":". 11-09-2014, 08:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-09T19:49:25-08:00","id":307778,"title":"","content":"You can make it to the edge of the dust cloud, certainly. Some of the cars might be a *bit* better protected than out in the open, but by opening the doors to get in, you'd let the dust in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-09T23:22:28-08:00","id":307925,"title":"","content":"Alright, haul the kid out, but first, let's do a little Laying On Hands on the mother, so she doesn't bleed out while I'm saving the baby. Eternal Spring 3 is an instant action, I can do it and then move.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4711714/\" target=\"_blank\">Be HEALED! 1 glamour, 2 WP spent. (11d10.hitsopen(9,10)=3)</a><br /> <br /> Rather unimpressive, but what the hell? I'm focusing on downgrading her last three Lethal wounds to Bashing, Cost recorded on sheet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T16:46:07-08:00","id":308608,"title":"","content":"Question - why do you say &quot;two willpower spent?&quot; The contract only costs one WP, and you can only spend one WP a round.<br /> <br /> And that roll's far from unimpressive. counting the 8s, 9s, and 10s up it's an exceptional success.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T18:55:34-08:00","id":308714,"title":"","content":"Ah, I'd forgotten that. I spent another for bonus dice, so snip the last three, which means I lose a success.<br /> <br /> But thankfully (?) I also putzed up the code (9, 10 rather than 8, 10) so I've still got four successes left! So yeah, 4 lethal downgraded to bashing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3994,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","user":"Dwyad","date":". 11-11-2014, 12:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T08:34:34-08:00","id":309158,"title":"","content":"Also, AT? Any time you're ready. Whether or not you get that car off the ledge, we're gonna need somebody to bodily pull these doors off. I'm not hauling this woman through a window, stabilized or no.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T16:08:24-08:00","id":309545,"title":"","content":"Hello - sorry for the absence.<br /> As far as the account goes, I have created an account twice, but I am not allowed to login in until I confirm an email sent to me... which never arrived <i>both</i> times I set up the account.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2734-atwannabe","name":"ATwannabe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2734_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T16:12:29-08:00","id":309550,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4714082/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4714082/</a> success on perception check. I am not really sure how to convey much else in prose right now... can the perception check give me a little insight into what is going on around Freddy?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2734-atwannabe","name":"ATwannabe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2734_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T17:55:02-08:00","id":309677,"title":"","content":"You checked your spam folder?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-12T18:04:41-08:00","id":310768,"title":"","content":"yup. I signed up again yesterday and I still have no email activation link, checked my spam folder and found nothing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theony