ulling on this door...<br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4726830/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4726830/</a> 2 succ<br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4726831/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4726831/</a> 3 succ<br /> <br /> Hopefully that'll do it!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2734-atwannabe","name":"ATwannabe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2734_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T18:45:59-08:00","id":320302,"title":"","content":"After four rounds, the door lock breaks and you can pull it open.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T15:18:37-08:00","id":322229,"title":"","content":"Right, so about this whole de-amputation thing.<br /> <br /> Can sufficient amounts of Spring 3 do it, or do I have to get out the stitches and catgut relatively soon? I'm leaning toward the latter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T16:25:36-08:00","id":322259,"title":"","content":"You'll have to attach the foot (which will be an extended Medicine roll), followed by a long period of recovery and/or Spring 3 to seal it all up. We can go over the specifics once you get the lady to a more stable working environment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T04:15:23-08:00","id":322651,"title":"","content":"Finally posted again, sorry for another delay. Hopefully I can keep pace from here on out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T16:53:03-08:00","id":327492,"title":"","content":"Anyone waiting on me? Check your PMs if you are, and if there's something missing, let me know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T16:54:56-08:00","id":327494,"title":"","content":"Got caught up in real life, sorry. moment","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T01:11:29-08:00","id":328989,"title":"","content":"Can we just assume Fred IS helping carry this woman into the backseat of Mal's car, and she DID reclaim the baby from the driver? With them taken care of, for now, they can finally take a little look at the thing that smashed into the bridge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T15:21:06-08:00","id":329592,"title":"","content":"Hey guys, I'm sorry I've been out for so long, that's not cool of me.<br /> <br /> I started taking graduate courses on top of my regular job, and although in the early fall things seemed pretty reasonable, they are now not as reasonable. My new semester started recently, and I have been juggling a lot to keep on track of my own work as well as teaching my courses. I regret to say that I don't have much spare time any more, and I must bow out.<br /> <br /> I know that my character was right in the middle of something, and that this creates issues for everyone involved, but I think it is in the best interest of the story to withdraw sooner, rather than later.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the time, however brief. And best of luck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2734-atwannabe","name":"ATwannabe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2734_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T20:52:11-08:00","id":329854,"title":"","content":":-( Sorry to hear it, AT, but real life has to come first so I understand. Good luck with everything.<br /> <br /> So! I'm going to take a look and see about finding another player to fill in the blanks, if you guys like.<br /> <br /> And yeah, for now Fred is NPC'd out. He'll be big, burly, and helpful, but with little initiative of his own.<br /> <br /> Dwy, you do indeed get woman and baby into your car and out of the (finally beginning to settle) cloud.<br /> <br /> Whatcha wanna do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","user":"HobbitGuy1420","date":". 12-03-2014, 11:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-04T00:35:43-08:00","id":329929,"title":"","content":"Seems like step one is checking out whatever Thing hit the bridge. Probably important, maybe Fae, so even if it's Masked I wanna get eyes on it before somebody drags it off.<br /> <br /> Step two is getting the woman back to the Clinic. Which is to say,, an abandoned auto shop repurposed as a back-alley hospital. I suppose a real hospital works too, but after all this, I'd rather get the credit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-04T19:31:32-08:00","id":330713,"title":"","content":"Heh. Priorities. :-)<br /> <br /> Give me a quick perception check to find the impact crater (reduce the penalty from the cloud by 1 since it's starting to disperse). <br /> <br /> I have a couple potentials in mind to join the game. Do you guys want to stick with what we have or invite some new blood? Should I stick with one, or add two (which I think we can support, though no more than that, I think)?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-06T08:12:17-08:00","id":332225,"title":"","content":"...It's a crater,. toward the end of the bridge, doesn't seem terribly hard to find. And the penalty from the cloud was -1 to all actions, so..Nothing? Okay.. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4733202/\" target=\"_blank\">Finding a large hole in the ground. (5d10.hitsopen(8,10)=1)</a> <br /> <br /> No opinion on new blood, except &quot;will they actually post often?&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-06T10:08:50-08:00","id":332264,"title":"","content":"I've only RPed with them in a chat, rather than PbP, so I'm afraid I don't know.<br /> <br /> And you're right. Sort of silly to ask for that, wasn't it? Ah well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T23:16:45-08:00","id":333808,"title":"","content":"Separation 1 says NOPE, I will gleefully tapdance on this bridge, and it will abide me.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4734944/\" target=\"_blank\">Not putting up with gravity's bullshit. (6d10.hitsopen(8,9)=5)</a><br /> <br /> Exceptional success! Which means that I also jump and climb real good, so not terribly useful, just neat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T05:14:07-08:00","id":334136,"title":"","content":"Oh, Separation 1, you rascal.<br /> <br /> All righty. You get into the crater easily enough to find... A lump of rock.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","user":"HobbitGuy1420","date":". 12-08-2014, 08:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T07:24:01-08:00","id":334193,"title":"","content":"How big of a lump of rock are we talkin' here? Big enough to hold on both hands? Long as a forearm? Longer still? Sounds like we're describing an oblong or cylindrical mass, if it could be mistaken for a tusk . Could this thing fit in a trunk?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T17:17:13-08:00","id":334657,"title":"","content":"It's about 6-8 inches in diameter at its biggest point, and it's very roughly spheroid, barring the tusklike protusion. It could easily fit in a trunk - or even a backpack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-10T14:54:33-08:00","id":336336,"title":"","content":"I'm assuming Free is a Known Thing around here, even if she's seldom seen. Mal knows, at least, that there's a girl who knows way too much,and the rumor is that she was abducted by aliens.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value