barely started anyways. That, and the guy's writing is pretty good, so it looks like he'll be a fine addition to the crew.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-15T05:19:30-08:00","id":340727,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/296605-changeling-the-lost-unseen-costs-ic?p=335163#post335163\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g...163#post335163</a> included the dice pool. This particular instance wasn't hacking, though you can certainly attempt a hack on future attempts.<br /> <br /> Results in the IC thread!<br /> <br /> ...oh, this didn't post last night. But you replied anyway, so, uh... cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-15T11:33:22-08:00","id":341021,"title":"","content":"As noted, my opinion on new blood is &quot;can they post?&quot; Bad writing doesn't doom games, and good writing won't save them - though the latter's preferable to the former, naturally. Inertia is death, momentum is life, it's that simple.<br /> <br /> Speaking of which, Mal has a foot to reattach and a meteor (?!?) to examine!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-15T21:29:04-08:00","id":341534,"title":"","content":"I'd thought you were going to arrive at the destination first - fair enough! Judging by her Resources level I'm assuming this warehouse is owned by some of her underworld Allies?<br /> <br /> Okay. Not sure which one you'll do first, so I'll give you both rules. The foot attachment is an extended Int + Medicine roll, with a penalty of -2 to the roll applied because you're basically having to reopen a mostly-healed wound to do the reattaching, which is difficult, touchy work. Each roll represents 30 minutes of work.<br /> <br /> Examining the rock will involve Wits rolls, with several skills potentially applicable - most obviously Science to determine what the heck it might be, but other skills may bear other fruit; check with me before rolling as some might have penalties or bonuses involved.<br /> <br /> I've invited EM to join up and given them the thread URLs. Say HI, EvilMarmelade!<br /> <br /> Okay. Anyone else waiting on El Storyteller-o?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-16T06:15:01-08:00","id":341822,"title":"","content":"Hey there, fellas!<br /> <br /> Thank you for your welcome. I'm currently in the process of designing my character, but I just want to say a few things : <br /> @Dwyad : I try to post daily, and sometimes even twice a day. I work at home, so I'm quite available. I may be away for a day sometimes, but it's pretty unusual. <br /> <br /> @Everyone : I should mention something though : I'm french, and as such, english is not my first language. So, feel free to offer me some criticism if you find my writing heavy or boring, as long as it's helpful. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Also, this means that I might have some weird posting hours compared to you all, but this is PbP, this shouldn't be a problem.<br /> <br /> Alright. I already have a character concept in mind, but I'm not exactly happy with it, so I'm gonna work on it. Maybe fleshing him out, or creating a new one. I'll try to make it quick!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-16T10:25:02-08:00","id":342072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HobbitGuy1420</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/296611-changeling-the-lost-unseen-costs-ooc?p=341534#post341534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd thought you were going to arrive at the destination first - fair enough! Judging by her Resources level I'm assuming this warehouse is owned by some of her underworld Allies?<br /> <br /> Okay. Not sure which one you'll do first, so I'll give you both rules. The foot attachment is an extended Int + Medicine roll, with a penalty of -2 to the roll applied because you're basically having to reopen a mostly-healed wound to do the reattaching, which is difficult, touchy work. Each roll represents 30 minutes of work.<br /> <br /> Examining the rock will involve Wits rolls, with several skills potentially applicable - most obviously Science to determine what the heck it might be, but other skills may bear other fruit; check with me before rolling as some might have penalties or bonuses involved.<br /> <br /> I've invited EM to join up and given them the thread URLs. Say HI, EvilMarmelade!</div> </div> </div> </div>1: It's abandoned, by definition it isn't &quot;owned&quot; with money - if she weren't here, this would be a nest of squatters instead. She's ruthlessly exploited her ability to patch people up with paperclips and bubblegum, so she doesn't need to furnish it with expensive medical tools. There are workbenches and tables, belts for tying patients off (and down) plus trays of tools more at home in a garage, a cutlery set, and a sewing kit. Her underworld allies have helped since then, ensuring that interlopers feel most unwelcome and supplying stolen electricity to work by, but she was doing this before she had them, 'cause that's how she got them.<br /> <br /> 2: There's a reason I didn't heal her Bashing damage. Mal wants her knocked the fuck out for this, for obvious reasons. When she's done with the time-sensitive operation, the rock will still be a rock.<br /> <br /> 3: Hi, SinisterJam! Any details on this concept of yours?<br /> <br /> So let's see how long it takes Mal to pin a foot back on!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4742285/\" target=\"_blank\">The knee bone's connected t the thigh bone. (6d10.hitsopen(8,9)=6)</a> Oh hell yes!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4742286/\" target=\"_blank\">The thigh bone's connected to the ankle bone. (6d10.hitsopen(8,9)=4)</a><br /> <br /> And for good measure. You didn't give a target number, but she either did it in 30 minutes or an hour, depending on whether she needed 5 or 10 successes.<br /> <br /> Now, let's skip all that pesky convalescing with s'more magic. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4742301/\" target=\"_blank\">BE HEALED! ( -1 Glamour, -1 WP) (8d10.hitsopen(8,9)=4)</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GdLXfGTNBgE\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GdLXfGTNBgE\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GdLXfGTNBgE\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GdLXfGTNBgE </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3994,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","user":"Dwyad","date":". 12-16-2014, 01:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-16T11:50:17-08:00","id":342114,"title":"","content":"20 sux actually, but you're doing very very well!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-16T12:13:32-08:00","id":342133,"title":"","content":"?!?<br /> <br /> Alright..<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4742441/\" target=\"_blank\">The ankle bone's connected to the foot bone. (6d10.hitsopen(8,9)=1)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4742454/\" target=\"_blank\">And the foot bone's connected to the toe bone. (6d10.hitsopen(8,9)=6)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4742498/\" target=\"_blank\">Dem bones, dem bones.. (6d10.hitsopen(8,9)=2)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4742500/\" target=\"_blank\">Dem craazy bones! (6d10.hitsopen(8,9)=1)</a><br /> <br /> 6+4+1+6+2+1. 20, on the dot. Three hours, no complications. Still an unmitigated medical miracle, all told. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-16T13:40:58-08:00","id":342189,"title":"","content":"Undoubtedly!! You get that foot assembled in a remarkable time, given a single unaided surgeon in a dirty garage. All that's left when you're done is a thin, almost decorative scar encircling the woman's upper ankle. It actually swirls into some quite attractive patterns, if you say so yourself. The woman hasn't awakened yet, but she may soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.