le=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for the delay, holidays and all, as well as other things. Hopefully I'll be able to get in the groove.</div> </div> </div> </div>Second verse, same as the first, <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4747847/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4747847/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4747847/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4747847/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T04:14:31-08:00","id":351496,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwyad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/296611-changeling-the-lost-unseen-costs-ooc?p=351321#post351321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Second verse, same as the first,</div> </div> </div> </div>Well excuse me if I recently had some end-of-the-year exams since this game started and had to sort out fiances for next year during this month on top of holidays. Besides, I promptly replied to the latest post in the IC thread, so cut me some slack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T10:10:45-08:00","id":351776,"title":"","content":"Correct me if I'm wrong, Dwy, but I suspect she was actually saying that your reasoning and justifications apply to her as well, Carp.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T12:16:14-08:00","id":351898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HobbitGuy1420</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/296611-changeling-the-lost-unseen-costs-ooc?p=351776#post351776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Correct me if I'm wrong, Dwy, but I suspect she was actually saying that your reasoning and justifications apply to her as well, Carp.</div> </div> </div> </div>If that's the case, then I apologize. Although I doubt it is because it's a rather odd way of saying it. Usually you would say that if someone said the same kinda thing before, which I did at one point. So I thought she was referring to that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T16:58:28-08:00","id":352075,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>crapcarp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/296611-changeling-the-lost-unseen-costs-ooc?p=351898#post351898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If that's the case, then I apologize. Although I doubt it is because it's a rather odd way of saying it. Usually you would say that if someone said the same kinda thing before, which I did at one point. So I thought she was referring to that.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, the GM has the right of it, and I don't even recall you saying any such thing in this thread. I've recently been shamefully absent for similar reasons.<br /> <br /> If I were going to throw stones from my glass house, I'd probably pelt EvilMarmalade, who seems to have up an' vanished into the aether.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T04:55:30-08:00","id":352561,"title":"","content":"Fair enough, Dwyad is right, I shouldn't have disappeared like that. Truth is that I got tangled in my finals, then went to my parents' for the holidays, and of course, I forgot to take my Changeling books. Busy as I was, I only had time to post on my two other rp I'm doing here on this forum. That was disrespectful of me to leave you all hanging, I'm really sorry for that.<br /> <br /> However, right now, I've come up with two different character concepts, but I'm not happy with either of those. I'd like your input on those.<br /> <br /> -A Metalflesh/Stonebones, who was taken to become a bronze golem assigned to guard the arabic-themed royal palace of his Keeper. Problem is, I don't really know what court would fit him. I have trouble coming up with characterization for him : what does he do now, what kind of dude was he before his Durance...<br /> <br /> -A Woodblood, who was a central part of his Keeper's garden. I'd like to make him Spring, but I don't really see where he could fit in the team. You already have a medic, and two social characters. I'll add another kith to him more suited to his specialization. I'm thinking, of course, of Flowering for social, or Woodwalker for...well, I don't really know, but maybe something else? Soldier, or Gargantuan, if I go for some sort of Ent?<br /> <br /> Of course, given my absence, I'll understand if you decide that you don't want me as a player though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T07:41:41-08:00","id":352646,"title":"","content":"As long as it's not a habitual thing I won't penalize you for a brief absence. Too many, though, and you'll be flayed - but gently!<br /> <br /> Either character could work - I think the first sounds cool, but an Ent is never a bad thing. If you feel like chatting to help flesh out either character, just let me know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T14:03:51-08:00","id":353108,"title":"","content":"HobbitGuy, who's Bob and why would Dale give him a kitten? Did I miss something?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/296611-changeling-the-lost-unseen-costs-ooc?p=352561#post352561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">However, right now, I've come up with two different character concepts, but I'm not happy with either of those. I'd like your input on those.<br /> <br /> -A Metalflesh/Stonebones, who was taken to become a bronze golem assigned to guard the arabic-themed royal palace of his Keeper. Problem is, I don't really know what court would fit him. I have trouble coming up with characterization for him : what does he do now, what kind of dude was he before his Durance...<br /> <br /> -A Woodblood, who was a central part of his Keeper's garden. I'd like to make him Spring, but I don't really see where he could fit in the team. You already have a medic, and two social characters. I'll add another kith to him more suited to his specialization. I'm thinking, of course, of Flowering for social, or Woodwalker for...well, I don't really know, but maybe something else? Soldier, or Gargantuan, if I go for some sort of Ent?</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Metalflesh/Earthbones:</b> Well, the Gentry always abduct humans for a reason. Granted, that reason usually isn't very good or makes little sense if at all, but there's always a reason. There's always something that draws their attention. I'd suggest determining that reason and going from there. Is it because he was a bouncer before his Durance? If so, what sort of life must the guy have had that led him to being a bouncer? Was their Keeper impressed by their relative stoicism while braving the Thorns? If so, what sort of experience did they go through that gave them such an incredible level of discipline and self-control?<br /> <br /> <b>Woodblood:</b> We have a doctor, a socialite, and a detective(I'm guessing Fred's player had to quit or something). None of these guys have very much in the way of combat, so perhaps making him combat-based would be the way to go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T21:47:10-08:00","id":353452,"title":"","content":"Little bit of worldbuilding - he's a carnivorous Hobgoblin, something like a crocodile crossed with an elephant crossed with the squirrelly guy in the park that sells &quot;rolex&quot; watches. Sometimes, if he gets some meat, he'll clue in the Lost on what's going on in the Hedge. Sometimes, if you don't bring enough, you might be the meat. <br /> <br /> I sometimes throw in little details like that to flesh out the setting. Most of the time they're just extra tidbits and can be taken or ignored at your leisure. Most of the time. &gt;:-D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T04:02:13-08:00","id":353598,"title":"","content":"Invoking the clause in itself will not cost Glamour, since the Catch is that the target doesn't know the name of the invoker (the perks of a<i> nomme de guerre</i>). However, considering that the target resists with Composure and there might be another penalty on top of that, Dale might spend Glamour on the roll anyways to enhance the dice pool with his Darkling Blessing. How much depends on the total resistance and penalty, so I'll need some feedback on that.<br /> <br /> Also, what would you have me roll for investigating the plinth (to be fair, I have a good idea, but I wanna make sure for good measure).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HobbitGuy1420</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/296611-changeling-the-lost-unseen-costs-ooc?p=353452#post353452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Little bit of worldbuilding - he's a carnivorous Hobgoblin, something like a crocodile crossed with an elephant crossed with the squirrelly guy in the park that sells &quot;rolex&quot; watches. Sometimes, if he gets some meat, he'll clue in the Lost on what's going on in the Hedge. Sometimes, if you don't bring enough, you might be the meat.<br /> <br /> I sometimes throw in little details like that to flesh out the setting. Most of the time they're just extra tidbits and can be taken or ignored at your leisure. Most of the time. &gt;:-D</div> </div> </div> </div>Alright, that's pretty cool and all, but I would recommend that when you spring up one of those things for the first time you tell us about it. Afterall, we players should know what our characters know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T07:21:04-08:00","id":353699,"title":"","content":"I tentatively vote for the golem - we can always use a strong silent type. There are two general possibilities I can see here..<br /> <br /> 1: His Keeper chose him because he's already a guardian of sorts. So,. bouncer. bodyguard, gang enforcer, or just someone fiercely protective. He could've been present for an attempted abduction, throwing himself at the Fae to protect someone more important.<br /> <br /> 2: His keeper chose him because he has a strong affinity with earth and metal. Construction worker, welder, miner - lots of salt-of-the-earth manual labor here. He could end up a surprisingly crafty brute - for all our Wizened, we don't really have anyone good at making things, so there's a niche.<br /> <br /> As to his Court? Well, Summer seems the obvious choice, embracing his militaristic purpose and the heat of his desert Durance, but I find that nearly all courts can fit nearly all concepts, it's just a matter of mindset. You just escaped from Hell, how do you deal with that?<br /> <br /> The Summer courtier says &quot;I want to hurt Them even worse than they hurt me.&quot;<br /> The Spring courtier says &quot;I want to reclaim my life as best I can, and try to forget this madness.&quot;<br /> The Autumn courtier says &quot;I want to know what just happened, what I am now, and what *they* are.&quot;<br /> The Winter courtier says &quot;I want to be safe, at all costs. I never want to be wounded again.&quot;<br /> <br /> Given these broad strokes, he's probably Summer-ish? If not, he's in the running for some Goodwill.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3994-dwyad","name":"Dwyad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T07:59:43-08:00","id":353733,"title":"","content":"Total penalties on the roll are -5 - he's a tough mother-shut yo' mouth!<br /> <br /> To investigate, you'll want Int + Investigation, possibly supplemented by other skills for analysis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T09:45:05-08:00","id":353799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwyad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/296611-changeling-the-lost-unseen-costs-ooc?p=353699#post353699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I tentatively vote for the golem - we can always use a strong silent type. There are two general possibilities I can see here..<br /> <br /> 1: His Keeper chose him because he's already a guardian of sorts. So,. bouncer. bodyguard, gang enforcer, or just someone fiercely protective. He could've been present for an attempted abduction, throwing himself at the Fae to protect someone more important.<br /> <br /> 2: His keeper chose him because he has a strong affinity with earth and metal. Construction worker, welder, miner - lots of salt-of-the-earth manual labor here. He could end up a surprisingly crafty brute - for all our Wizened, we don't really have anyone good at making things, so there's a niche.<br /> <br /> As to his Court? Well, Summer seems the obvious choice, embracing his militaristic purpose and the heat of his desert Durance, but I find that nearly all courts can fit nearly all concepts, it's just a matter of mindset. You just escaped from Hell, how do you deal with that?<br /> <br /> The Summer courtier says &quot;I want to hurt Them even worse than they hurt me.&quot;<br /> The Spring courtier says &quot;I want to reclaim my life as best I can, and try to forget this madness.&quot;<br /> The Autumn courtier says &quot;I want to know what just happened, what I am now, and what *they* are.&quot;<br /> The Winter courtier says &quot;I want to be safe, at all costs. I never want to be wounded again.&quot;<br /> <br /> Given these broad strokes, he's probably Summer-ish? If not, he's in the running for some Goodwill.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks, your guidelines are really useful! I'll go with the golem then : I'm more inspired by him anyway. Right now, it's between Summer and Spring, but either way, he'll have some Goodwill with the other court. I'll reread quickly the Chapter 2 of Lords of Summer, to make my choice, and start working on my character tonight.<br /> <br /> HobbitGuy, do you have some houserules for character creation?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T10:12:14-08:00","id":353829,"title":"","content":"The first dot of seasonal Mantle is free (any beyond the first or dots in nonseasonal Mantle cost as usual). We're using the graduated Merit version of Dual-Kith, so you'd be looking at a 3-dotter for an out-of-seeming Stonebones. Standard creation plus 20 XP, and additional XP will be given for your background - the better and more useful, the more XP. I can't recall any more house rules, but once I get home from work I can look through the threads. <br /> <br /> Oh, and on the subject of XP, all active characters gain 2 for completing that last scene.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T11:52:53-08:00","id":353953,"title":"","content":"Invisible Castle is down at the moment, so I used a different site for the rolls.<br /> <br /> Getting that tough mofo's fear: <a href=\"http://sheetgen.dalines.net/wiki/WikiDiceRoller?hash=26eea315\" target=\"_blank\">[Wits + Wyrd + WP + 2 Glamour - 5: 1 success]</a><br /> <br /> Investigating the plinth and surrounding area: <a href=\"http://sheetgen.dalines.net/wiki/WikiDiceRoller?hash=ec904dee\" target=\"_blank\">[Intelligence + Investigation: 1 success]</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 12-29-2014, 02:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T15:12:39-08:00","id":354122,"title":"","content":"I apologize for being slow right now....I'm in the States rather than at home in Japan...at my parents' house, so internet access is spotty. Plus doing lots with family and friends.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-10T00:06:50-08:00","id":365181,"title":"","content":"Well, it looks like Invisible Castle ain't coming back anytime soon, so I guess we'll have to use this other site instead. Anyways, here's Dale's second roll. Do you want me to just put the rest of the rolls in one (for a total of 35), or just do them one at a time, 'cause you did talk about some possible modifiers before.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://sheetgen.dalines.net/wiki/WikiDiceRoller?hash=5e91fd5e\" target=\"_blank\">[2nd roll, Intelligence + Investigation = 7 dice: 3 successes]</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-10T00:36:23-08:00","id":365192,"title":"","content":"I'm back in Japan, is Free at the Doc's place yet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-10T11:19:42-08:00","id":365552,"title":"","content":"Sure, free can show up.<br /> <br /> Carp, go ahead - but after the first half hour (3 rolls, including the two previously made) Mr. Barrister starts moving from passive-aggressive commentary to actually passively impeding your rolls - standing in your way, making noise, and the like. Nothing overt that could get him into trouble, but enough to inflict a -1 penalty for every roll after the third. Your choice if you want to proceed in spite of it or if you want to try to deal with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-10T11:50:59-08:00","id":365568,"title":"","content":"3rd roll <a href=\"http://sheetgen.dalines.net/wiki/WikiDiceRoller?hash=78d1dbb1\" target=\"_blank\">[Intelligence + Investigation = 7 dice: 1 success]</a><br /> <br /> 4th roll <a href=\"http://sheetgen.dalines.net/wiki/WikiDiceRoller?hash=410021de\" target=\"_blank\">[Intelligence + Investigation - 1 = 6 dice: 3 successes]</a><br /> <br /> Huh, got more successes with Barrister in the way. Time to make an IC post now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T01:14:32-08:00","id":377041,"title":"","content":"Well, Dale's gonna continue the investigation. Any modifiers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T19:52:05-08:00","id":377739,"title":"","content":"He's going to get more overt now. An additional -1 for each new roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T23:13:59-08:00","id":377847,"title":"","content":"Alright, so what I decided to do was put all the remaining rolls together, but since the penalties are stacking and I've decided to spend a WP on the last roll, I'm gonna take the appropriate dice off of each roll (which means I'm taking the last die off the 5th roll, and the last two on the 6th). So I'll put up the actual dice results for convenience.<br /> <br /> 5th roll - [5,4,2,8,2] - 1 success<br /> 6th roll - [5,1,6,2] - 0 successes<br /> 7th roll - [8,1,3,6,9,2] - 2 successes<br /> <br /> Link: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4756112/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4756112/</a><br /> <br /> Heh, went a little better than I expected, considering. Onto the IC post! By the way, how're the rest of you guys going?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T05:38:58-08:00","id":377974,"title":"","content":"apparently my notifications are spotty...it only recently started informing me of new posts again.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T20:16:36-08:00","id":378627,"title":"","content":"It happens. I've noticed that I have to check the threads frequently and delete old notifications before I can get new ones.<br /> <br /> So! To investigate the rock, roll Wits + whatever skill you want to use. Science and Investigation could both be useful, and if you have other potentials, run 'em by me. Each roll is 10 minutes of looking over stuff. <br /> <br /> Carp, assuming Sullivan is gonna go out looking for someone to terrorize, give me a wits + composure, with a penalty to indicate how picky you're gonna be. No penalty means you'll make do with scaring anyone, -5 means you want to find someone either currently violating or directly about to violate a dangerous supernatural space (or whatever other criteria you have for who Sullivan freaks out).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","user":"HobbitGuy1420","date":". 01-22-2015, 11:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T03:30:23-08:00","id":378875,"title":"","content":"Considering Dale's a little tired, what with spending both 2 WP and Glamour early on in the night, he'll only be a little picky. Like someone or a small group that could be easily led into an isolated area, like someone who's a little curious already or just looking for something fun/distracting to do. -1 perhaps?<br /> <br /> If he finds someone who meets that criteria, he'll devise an appropriate lure for them, a fabrication about something they'd be interested in (something like &quot;Do you know of that haunted house down the street?&quot;. Cliche I know, but that's just an example). Once he's got them hooked and isolated, then he'll start his fear-mongering centered around Sullivan by invoking the Tale of Baba Yaga clause (Core p. 157). Finally, he'll use the Bugbear's Mask to suddenly appear as Sullivan right before them (probably after hiding away from them first so they don't see him change into Sullivan, considering the nature of the transformation). Then he'll glaze up for all they're worth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-24T16:04:39-08:00","id":380536,"title":"","content":"All right - roll it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-24T23:29:59-08:00","id":380815,"title":"","content":"<br /> Wits + Science: 1 success<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758708/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758708/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758708/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758708/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Wits + Investigation: 2 successes + 10 again<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758710/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758710/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758710/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758710/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> 10 again: 0 successes<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758711/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758711/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758711/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758711/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> If &quot;Fringe Events&quot; Investigation specialty applies, one more die: 0 successes<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758713/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758713/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758713/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758713/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Just in case, rolling Wits + Occult - The Others specialty: 2 successes<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758714/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758714/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758714/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4758714/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-25T12:51:01-08:00","id":381288,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4759220/\" target=\"_blank\">Finding target(s): [Wits + Composure - 1 = 4 dice: 2 successes]</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4759223/\" target=\"_blank\">Amount of targets: [1 die, amount is the number rolled halved, rounded up: 9; so 5 targets]</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4759219/\" target=\"_blank\">Enticing target(s) through lying: [Manipulation + Subterfuge = 5 dice: 3 successes]</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4759229/\" target=\"_blank\">Fear-mongering (Tale of Baba Yaga clause of Fleeting Autumn Contract): [Manipulation + Intimidation + Autumn Mantle + 1 - Target's Highest Composure = 6 dice, 6 rolls, 5 minutes/roll: 5 successes on first roll]</a><br /> <br /> For these last rolls I've made a ton of assumptions. 1.) I don't know whether or not Specialties apply to Contract rolls, so I've decided not to apply it. 2.) I've assumed all four people are average, so that would mean 2-3 Composure, I went with 3 as the highest among them. 3.) Dale has managed to isolate them in a creepy area, so I gave a +1 bonus for spooky ambiance. 4.) Since Dale has worked pretty hard to establish the myth of Sullivan, I've decided that the Catch has been fulfilled.<br /> <br /> As for the roll results, I needed 5 successes (one per person) in 6 rolls, and since I got both that amount and exceptional success on the first roll, the people have to run or cower in fear for 3 turns (equal to Dale's Wyrd dots). Dale takes one of these turns to slip away from the group, another to change to Sullivan, and the last to scare them as Sullivan (spending a Glamour point to activate the token).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4759248/\" target=\"_blank\">Slipping away: [Dexterity + Stealth + Specialty + 2 = 10 dice + 9-again: 5 successes]</a><br /> <br /> I gave a +2 here because it's quite easy to slip away when people are running away in fear.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4759262/\" target=\"_blank\">Harvesting Glamour: [Manipulation + Intimidation + Specialty + Harvest + 5 = 13 dice: 10 successes]</a> (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hw2WqvbDt5g\" target=\"_blank\">DAAAMN!</a>)<br /> <br /> I gave a +5 because Dale got an exceptional success on the Contract roll, they're running away in fear, and Sullivan just appeared right in front of them.<br /> <br /> Let me know if you want me to change any of these rolls for any reason. As for the flavor results, do you wanna write it up or should I?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-25T12:58:50-08:00","id":381294,"title":"","content":"Er... I meant just to roll the finding-people roll. I'd rather roleplay through at least some of the scene, unless the group doesn't want to take time on it. And (don't take me wrong here) I'd rather you wait for my sayso regarding modifiers to rolls, rather than assuming. Most of your thoughts seem fair, but it might not always be the case.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T12:49:18-08:00","id":383461,"title":"","content":"Oh, I just thought of making all the rolls first, then roleplay it all out in one big post to get it outta the way quickly. After all, Dale's just gathering Glamour here. He's not interacting with any of the other PCs, NPCs (unless you count the targets to be NPCs), or the plot in any way.<br /> <br /> Don't worry about me taking it the wrong way, you are the Storyteller here after all. That's why I asked for you to let me know about rerolling anything due to differing dice pools. And it's all good, we can just take the first roll and ignore the rest if you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T13:14:55-08:00","id":383486,"title":"","content":"I also need some indication as to the results of my rolls in order to proceed with an IC post.<br /> <br /> Unless you have posted an IC thing and I wasn't notified....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T19:12:26-08:00","id":385712,"title":"","content":"I wasn't sure if you were going after it just to harvest Glamour, or to try to further Sullivan's story, or both in some proportion.<br /> <br /> *looks over the rolls*<br /> <br /> I'm going to say that the rolls as they are stand. You're now full on Glamour, and in fact stand a chance of a glamour high. GIve me a Resolve + Composure, please.<br /> <br /> Marmalade, if you're still around do you have a sheet for me to look at?<br /> <br /> Anything else I'm missing for you guys?<br /> <br /> Sorry I've not been the most responsive lately. Work has been... ergh. More ergh than usual.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","user":"HobbitGuy1420","date":". 01-29-2015, 10:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T03:21:43-08:00","id":388236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HobbitGuy1420</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/296611-changeling-the-lost-unseen-costs-ooc?p=385712#post385712\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wasn't sure if you were going after it just to harvest Glamour, or to try to further Sullivan's story, or both in some proportion.<br /> <br /> *looks over the rolls*<br /> <br /> I'm going to say that the rolls as they are stand. You're now full on Glamour, and in fact stand a chance of a glamour high. GIve me a Resolve + Composure, please.</div> </div> </div> </div>Alright, using the Bugbear's Mask gives Dale the Narcissism derangement. Reading up on that, it looks like I'm gonna have to make two Resolve + Composure rolls.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4765457/\" target=\"_blank\">Here they are.</a> (The first one is for resisting the Glamour high, the second one's resisting a bout of vanity)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T12:03:29-08:00","id":388705,"title":"","content":"You hold off the glamour high, but you *are* feeling all that and a chicken hat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}